{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multiprofile RNA-only model using PCA_n2000 encoding with avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5907 (F1: 0.5727), exceeding the multimodal baseline's 0.5266 accuracy. The result suggests multiprofile settings and aggregation may contribute to performance gains, but the exact impact of these changes remains uncertain. Further comparisons with other RNA-only configurations are needed to isolate their effects."
}

